WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:14.632
Taco: Look! Alex and Sue!

2
00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:17.124
Maxie: They are angry.

3
00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:21.827
Taco: Maxie, I am scared!

4
00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:26.050
Alex: Maxie! Taco! I am angry!

5
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:30.920
Sue: Yes, we are very angry!

6
00:00:30.921 --> 00:00:32.807
Maxie: I'm sorry.

7
00:00:32.808 --> 00:00:34.825
Taco: I'm sorry too.

8
00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:37.752
Alex: That's okay.

9
00:00:37.753 --> 00:00:41.318
Maxie and Taco: We are very sorry.

10
00:00:41.319 --> 00:00:43.698
Sue: Wow!

11
00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:46.617
Maxie: It's my magic marker.

12
00:00:46.618 --> 00:00:52.650
Alex and Sue: Magic marker? What's that?
